Install and configure the CrowdStrike integrations for mitigation controls monitoring","description":"The CrowdStrike Service Graph Connector and API integrations require separate configuration steps. You configure the CrowdStrike Service Graph Connector to import asset details. You configure the CrowdStrike API Integration to gather mitigation data about the assets that are monitored by CrowdStrike.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/spc-install-config-controls.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"task","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":3,"breadcrumb":["Policies for Exploit Protection \\(EDR\\)","Use mitigation controls","Security Posture Control","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#type-task"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/spc-install-config-controls.md"},
